<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">COURSE MATERIALS</view><view class="page-title">课程资料<text class="title-dot">.</text></view><view class="subtitle">玉龙AI优课 · 课后整理，从一份讲义开始</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在整理讲义…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card error-card">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:else><view class="course-label"><view class="course-label-line"></view><text>{{course.title}}</text></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{!course.enrolled}}">加入课程后，即可下载以下配套讲义。<view class="buy-link" bindtap="buy">前往加入课程 →</view></view><view class="file-card card" wx:for="{{materials}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="download"><view class="file-icon">{{item.extension}}</view><view class="file-content"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text>{{item.sizeText}} · {{item.extension}} 资料</text></view><view class="download-mark">{{downloading === item.id ? '…' : '↓'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!materials.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-icon">▤</view><view class="empty-title">老师还未上传资料</view><view class="empty-copy">稍后再来看看，新的知识正在路上</view></view><view class="materials-tip" wx:if="{{materials.length}}"><view>PDF 和 Office 讲义可直接预览</view><view>打开文档后，可从右上角菜单保存或分享</view></view></block></view>
